- Best validated modulus: 708.9 MPa (17.5wt%, 65°C, 6mm/s, N₂, 15s wait, 10°C bath, 1800s) — has an independent repeat (run2) at 474.7 MPa, showing high run-to-run variability. Not yet confirmed as reproducible.
- 667.1 MPa (18.5wt%, 25°C, 19mm/s, NoN₂, 330s, 5°C) — single measurement, no CV, no repeat.
- Many experiments yield no valid modulus (all fits discarded).

**Sparse/underrepresented regions for explore mode:**
- `bath_temp=5` with `polymer_wt` in 17–18 range and **no N₂**, moderate wait times — partially explored
- `mixing_temp` in 25–40°C range with `bath_temp=5`, **higher polymer_wt (19–20)**, **no N₂**, short wait — sparse
- `nips_bath_wait_time` near maximum (1800s) with `bath_temp=5`, `polymer_wt~18–19`, moderate speed, **no N₂** — underexplored
- `pullcast_speed` around 15–17 mm/s with `bath_temp=5`, `polymer_wt~18–19`, **no N₂**, short wait — not well covered

